factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The article says the puja is held at 1,208 places, but it also says 693 places are in Tirupur city and the rest across the division; the draft's reel_script and slides say the 1,208 figure is 'திருப்பூர் மாநகரம் உள்ளிட்ட' (including Tirupur city), which is consistent, but the slide 'எத்தனை இடங்கள்' line 1 says 'திருப்பூர் மாநகரம் உள்ளிட்ட 1,208 இடங்களில்' which is acceptable; however the slides_spec 'loc' and 'hl1' state the puja is in Tirupur city alone ('திருப்பூர் மாநகரில் நாளை கோ பூஜை'), which mischaracterizes the scope as covering only the city while the article says 1,208 places across the city and division.
  The article says the event is 'நாளை(நவ.17)' (tomorrow, Nov 17); the draft's caption headline and slides say 'நாளை' and 'நவ. 17', consistent, but the reel_script says 'நவம்பர் 17ஆம் தேதி' which is correct; no issue here.
  The reel_script omits the detail that the event is for 'பாரம்பரியமான நாட்டு இன பசுக்களை வைத்து' with 'இன்று' in the article's text conflicting with 'நாளை'; the article itself is internally inconsistent (says 'நாளை' and 'இன்று'), and the draft does not flag this, which is a mixing of two different timing claims not addressed.
  The reel_script's claim that Krishna sent cows to pasture 'முதன்முதலில்' is accurate, but the reel_script omits that Krishna was entrusted with the calves by Nanda, and the article's key narrative point (Krishna at age five with Balarama) is reduced to 'கிருஷ்ணர் பசுக்களை முதன்முதலில் மேய்ச்சலுக்கு அனுப்பிய நாளை' without mentioning age five in the reel_script; the slides mention age five but the reel_script does not, which is a minor omission rather than an error.
  The slide line 'பாரம்பரிய நாட்டு பசுக்களை வைத்து பூஜை' under 'யார்' and the reel_script's phrase 'இந்தப் பூஜை நடத்தப்படுகிறது' are consistent; however the reel_script says the Samithi holds the puja 'மாதந்தோறும்' which the article supports.
